  <p id="c-songshu-077-liuping-wangjian:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-077-liuping-wangjian:p001:m0000" ref="f3x_mii_8ax">柳元景</persName>字<persName id="c-songshu-077-liuping-wangjian:p001:m0004" ref="f3x_mii_8ax">孝仁</persName>，河東解人也。曾祖<persName id="c-songshu-077-liuping-wangjian:p001:m0015" ref="5jc_z9b_i2n">卓</persName>，自本郡遷於襄陽，官至汝南太守。祖<persName id="c-songshu-077-liuping-wangjian:p001:m0033" ref="5jc_z9b_i2n_A">恬</persName>，西河太守。父<persName id="c-songshu-077-liuping-wangjian:p001:m0041" ref="5jc_z9b_i2n_AA">憑</persName>，馮翊太守。</p>
